lianzgi-equity-convertible-income-fund%23shareclass.N%2Fperiod.quarterly\u0026esheet=54598127\u0026newsitemid=20260902894376\u0026lan=en-US\u0026anchor=Virtus+Equity+%26amp%3B+Convertible+Income+Fund\u0026index=2\u0026md5=7f0db26a4f9d5d784443bb3530d05c4a","linkText":"Virtus Equity \u0026 Convertible Income Fund"}}," is a diversified closed-end fund that seeks total return comprised of capital appreciation, current income, and gains. Under normal circumstances, the Fund will invest at least 80% of its net assets (plus any borrowings for investment purposes) in a combination of equity securities and income-producing convertible securities. Virtus Investment Advisers, LLC, a registered investment adviser affiliated with Virtus Investment Partners, Inc., and ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink\u0026url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.virtus.com%2Finvestment-partners%2Fvoya-investment-management\u0026esheet=54598127\u0026newsitemid=20260902894376\u0026lan=en-US\u0026anchor=Voya+Investment+Management\u0026index=3\u0026md5=05c85922f9144a95174d3c6fb87aa9fd","linkText":"Voya Investment Management"}}," provide investment advisory services to the Fund pursuant to an advisory agreement and a sub-advisory agreement, respectively."]},{"type":"p","children":["For more information on the Fund, contact shareholder services at (866) 270-7788, by email at ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"http://mailto:closedendfunds@virtus.com","linkText":"closedendfunds@virtus.com"}},", or through the Closed-End Funds section of virtus.com."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Fund Risks"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["An investment in a fund is subject to risk, including the risk of possible loss of principal. A fund’s shares may be worth less upon their sale than what an investor paid for them. Shares of closed-end funds may trade at a premium or discount to their NAV. For more information about the Fund’s investment objective and risks, please see the Fund’s annual report. A copy of the Fund’s most recent annual report can be accessed through the Closed-End Funds section of virtus.com and may be obtained free of charge by contacting “Shareholder Services” as set forth at the end of this press release."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["About Virtus Investment Partners, Inc."]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Virtus Investment Partners (NYSE: VRTS) is a distinctive partnership of boutique investment managers singularly committed to the long-term success of individual and institutional investors. We provide investment products and services from our investment managers, each with a distinct investment style and autonomous investment process, as well as select subadvisers. Investment solutions are available across multiple disciplines and product types to meet a wide array of investor needs. Additional information about our firm, investment partners, and strategies is available at virtus.com."]},{"type":"p","children":["View source version on businesswire.com: https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260902894376/en/"]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"BusinessWire","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"business_wire"}]},{"title":"Dividends","args":[{"id":"section","value":"dividends"}]},{"title":"US stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"US"}]}],"robots":["noindex"],"copyright":"2026 Business Wire, Inc., All rights reserved.","id":"business_wire:0c30f4a2257bc:0","title":"Virtus Equity \u0026 Convertible Income Fund Announces Distribution and Discloses Sources of Distribution – Section 19(a) Notice","published":1788383100,"urgency":2,"relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"NYSE:NIE","logoid":"infracap-mlp","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"infracap-mlp"}}],"storyPath":"/news/business_wire:0c30f4a2257bc:0-virtus-equity-convertible-income-fund-announces-distribution-and-discloses-sources-of-distribution-section-19-a-notice/","read_time":201,"provider":{"id":"business_wire","nam